      "role": "user",
      "content": "the thing is it doesnt feel like a \"feeling\" or \"intuition\" though. it's literally visual. like the colors have a specific density to them. when i saw that red mist, it felt heavy, almost like a physical weight in the air before the car actually moved. and then a few days ago i was looking at a sequence of numbers on a screen and i saw these bright blue streaks around certain digits. i actually wrote them down and they matched the winning draw for that local lottery. if it was just radiation-induced visual disturbances, wouldn't they be more like static or flashes? why would they correspond so perfectly to actual events?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
